---
title: "initialize (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: caller is factory/deployer
    q_validate --> q_check_refund: validate config params
    q_check_refund --> q_error_refund: refundPeriodSeconds < 1 hour OR refundPeriodSeconds > 2 weeks
    q_error_refund --> [*]: revert InvalidRefundPeriod
    q_check_refund --> q_check_min: 1 hour <= refundPeriodSeconds <= 2 weeks
    q_check_min --> q_error_min: minimumInvestAmount == 0
    q_error_min --> [*]: revert InvalidMinimumInvest
    q_check_min --> q_check_addrs: minimumInvestAmount > 0
    q_check_addrs --> q_error_addrs: bidToken == address(0) OR projectAdmin == address(0)
    q_error_addrs --> [*]: revert InvalidAddress
    q_check_addrs --> q_set_config: addresses valid
    q_set_config --> q_set_times: store refundPeriodSeconds, minimumInvestAmount, bidToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry, fees
    q_set_times --> q_emit: startTime = block.timestamp, endTime = 0, hasEnded = false
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleInitialized

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: refundPeriodSeconds must be between 1 hour and 2 weeks inclusive
        INV-002: startTime is set to block.timestamp at initialization
        INV-003: endTime remains 0 until end() is called
        INV-004: hasEnded is false after initialization
    end note
